description:
The 3MT Preliminary Competition is a research communication competition developed by The University of Queensland. Graduate students have just three minutes to present a compelling oration on their research and its significance to a non-specialist audience. 3MT represents an invaluable opportunity for students to sharpen their research focus, improve their presentation skills, and perfect their elevator pitch for prospective employers and anyone else interested in learning about their research.


  &#160;


  All students who compete in the Preliminary Competition will receive 3MT gifts, a professional headshot and be entered into a prize drawing!

